1: maint set sync on
2: apropos show info
info mpi         Show information about the state of MPI internals.
maint show       Show information about the debugger environment.
show             Show information about the debugger environment.
show breakpoint  Show information about breakpoints.
show print       Show information about how things get printed.
3: apropos help
apropos          Search help for matching commands.
decomposition dim_order Display help about using decomposition "dim_order" command.
decomposition dimension Display help about using decomposition "dimension" command.
decomposition distribute Display help about using decomposition "distribute" command.
decomposition proc_grid Display help about using decomposition "proc_grid" command.
help             Display help information about commands.
4: q
